# Merge selected settings into the target machine's existing Codex config.
# Never replace that file wholesale.
#
# Nothing to merge at present.
#
# Rejected 2026-08-20: features.default_mode_request_user_input.
#
# Measured on Codex 0.147.0 under WSL, twice and consistent to the token, it
# adds ~11,000 tokens to the base prompt of every session. The tool it looked
# like it unlocked, request_user_input, is exposed with the flag off as well, so
# it does not grant the ability to ask a question; at most it raises the
# propensity to use it. That propensity was never measured on either machine.
# Codex additionally reports the flag as an under-development feature.
#
# Re-enable only against an observed behavioural difference that justifies the
# cost, and record the observation here.
